#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Pick building tool"
msgstr "Seleziona strumento di costruzione"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "No building tool at this location."
msgstr "Nessuno strumento di costruzione in questa posizione."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "This building tool is not available in this city."
msgstr "Questo strumento di costruzione non è ancora disponibile in questa città."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Selected: %s"
msgstr "Selezionato: %s"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Workspaces"
msgstr "Spazi di lavoro"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Building"
msgstr "Costruzione"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Finances"
msgstr "Finanze"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "City analysis"
msgstr "Analisi della città"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Window positions are remembered automatically."
msgstr "Le posizioni delle finestre vengono salvate automaticamente."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Arrange your city windows, then save their positions and visibility in a workspace."
msgstr "Disponi le finestre della città e salva le loro posizioni e visibilità in uno spazio di lavoro."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Save workspace"
msgstr "Salva spazio"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Restore workspace"
msgstr "Ripristina spazio"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
msgid "Reset window positions"
msgstr "Reimposta posizioni finestre"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K QoL UI translation; AI-assisted from English source.
